ing City: West Lafayette Job Description: Job Summary The Accounting Department at the Mitch Daniels School of Business, Purdue University, invites applications for a full-time Clinical Assistant Professor position in Accounting. The appointment is expected to begin in August 2027. The successful candidate will teach graduate and undergraduate accounting courses, including large-section accounting courses, engage in course development, and advise students. The successful candidate will also contribute in some or all of the following ways: Provide service that supports the administration, operation, and development of the Accounting Department, Mitch Daniels School of Business, Purdue University, and the accounting profession. Develop and manage relationships with external partners and stakeholders. Produce teaching-oriented scholarly work, such as textbooks or publications in educational journals, that promotes the academic reputation of the Accounting Department, Mitch Daniels School of Business, and Purdue University. Job Qualification Candidates must have a master’s degree or PhD in Accounting or a closely related field by the start date of the appointment. Candidates must have: Experience teaching accounting courses at both the graduate and undergraduate levels. Experience in course development. A minimum of three years of full-time teaching experience as an instructor or faculty member at a college or university that awards degrees in accounting. Application Procedure To apply, submit the following materials as PDF files: Curriculum vitae Teaching evaluations Statement describing how the candidate meets the job qualifications Names of references here: https://apps.it.purdue.edu/KARS/Apply/rRt2jrrrVC Review of applications will begin October 30, 2026, and continue until the position is filled. A background check will be required for employment in this position. Contact Information Michael Kregar (mkregar@purdue.edu) Clinical Associate Professor Search Chair for Clinical Assistant Professor Mitch Daniels School of Business Purdue University 100 S Grant St., West Lafayette, IN 47907 Purdue University is an equal opportunity/equal access university. Apply now Posting Start Date: 10/8/26 Search Jobs Careers Home View All Jobs Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. © Copyright 2024, Purdue University - An equal access/equal opportunity university"
